---
// post.kualta.dev/archive was the composer's Archive tab, whose clips play in the Footage tab now: the middleware
// rewrites it to /publish/archive before this renders, which opens the Footage tab on the same clip. It needs a page of
// its own because a path no page matches is answered with the prerendered 404, which never reaches the middleware. On
// any other host there's nothing here.
export const prerender = false;
return new Response("Not found", { status: 404 });
---
